  '**The count, which is the argument and not an opinion.** **In the spring round, nine schemes reported beneficiary numbers between one hundred and four and eleven hundred and six.** ⚠ **Both extremes are within the definition at paragraph 2.4 of the scheme rules, and I have scored both.**',
  '**Nobody who wrote the definition was careless.** **It reads _households served by the scheme and others affected_, and whoever drafted it was trying not to exclude a family that collects water from a scheme it is not registered against.** ⚠ **That is a real case and a reasonable instinct, and it is the whole of the difficulty.**',
